{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/mission_objective.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your crew are 'Echos,' remotely operated humanoid clones sent to scavenge abandoned stations and industrial zones. Your mission: collect valuable scrap, return to your train, and shred it to extract valuable metals. But be careful. More than an omnipresent gigacorporation is watching your steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AKAMORI ENTERPRISE</strong> welcomes you to your first shift!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/GIF_011.gif?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/dynamic_coop.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends or brave the stations alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find loot, shred it, and get paid \u2013 all while trying to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Communication is key</strong> \u2013 warn your friends of danger, or leave them behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Includes Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/survival_over_combat.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your environment, hide in shadows, and stay quiet. Noise attracts\u2026 things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are fragile. Stealth, timing, and instinct are your best defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use gadgets to increase your chances for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful where you go. Every step might be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the more you realize: some things cannot be stopped.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/survive.gif?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/procedurally_generated.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each station is procedurally generated, with shifting layouts and unpredictable dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two missions are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;things&quot; waiting for you will adapt. What worked last time might be useless now.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only refuge is the train.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/procedural.gif?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/a_train_that_grows.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the shredded materials and corporate credits for upgrades and gadgets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up your train, unlock tools, and deploy cunning defense mechanisms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Devices for navigation help you scavenge the most profitable areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repair damages to keep the train running.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/akamori_welcomes_you.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an Echo. You are property. You are replaceable. Do your job, follow protocol, and don\u2019t ask questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your shift begins now. The train won\u2019t wait \u2013 and neither will they.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3232000?t=1745873805","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3232000?t=1745873805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/887cd6ef3d4596317f50ee0a4a8f490b965613d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745873805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/887cd6ef3d4596317f50ee0a4a8f490b965613d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745873805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains stylized violence, blood, and unsettling themes.\r\nPlayers can expect moments of tension, disturbing imagery, and intense atmospheric horror. The world of echo//shredd explores psychological stress, synthetic bodies, and corporate dread through visual storytelling and immersive sound design. Some scenes may feature eerie depictions of gore, body horror, and existential unease \u2014 all in service of a gripping, mature narrative experience."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/mission_objective.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your crew are 'Echos,' remotely operated humanoid clones sent to scavenge abandoned stations and industrial zones. Your mission: collect valuable scrap, return to your train, and shred it to extract valuable metals. But be careful. More than an omnipresent gigacorporation is watching your steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AKAMORI ENTERPRISE</strong> welcomes you to your first shift!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/GIF_011.gif?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/dynamic_coop.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends or brave the stations alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find loot, shred it, and get paid \u2013 all while trying to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Communication is key</strong> \u2013 warn your friends of danger, or leave them behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Includes Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/survival_over_combat.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your environment, hide in shadows, and stay quiet. Noise attracts\u2026 things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are fragile. Stealth, timing, and instinct are your best defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use gadgets to increase your chances for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful where you go. Every step might be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the more you realize: some things cannot be stopped.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/survive.gif?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/procedurally_generated.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each station is procedurally generated, with shifting layouts and unpredictable dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two missions are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;things&quot; waiting for you will adapt. What worked last time might be useless now.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only refuge is the train.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/procedural.gif?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/a_train_that_grows.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the shredded materials and corporate credits for upgrades and gadgets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up your train, unlock tools, and deploy cunning defense mechanisms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Devices for navigation help you scavenge the most profitable areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repair damages to keep the train running.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/extras/akamori_welcomes_you.png?t=1745873805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an Echo. You are property. You are replaceable. Do your job, follow protocol, and don\u2019t ask questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your shift begins now. The train won\u2019t wait \u2013 and neither will they.</p>","developers":["Irregular Human"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232000/header.jpg?t=1745873805","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126477,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126477/movie480.mp4?t=1744756405","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126477/movie_max.mp4?t=1744756405"},"name":"echo//shredd Teaser-Trailer [01]","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126477/dcfc732ad8c235a4bb0c2bd0fcf8f784050153c7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744756405","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126477/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744756405","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126477/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744756405"}}],"name":"echo//shredd","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 CPU @ 3.00GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 560 GTX or better<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best enjoyed with a Microphone</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 960 GTX or better<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best enjoyed with a Microphone</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Irregular Human"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nMedo","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating